CMLDSA: third-party code in this directory

ML-DSA-65 and ML-DSA-87 (ml_dsa_65/, ml_dsa_87/)
  The pq-crystals "standard" reference implementation of ML-DSA (FIPS 204) as shipped in liboqs 0.14.0
  (src/sig/ml_dsa/pqcrystals-dilithium-standard_ml-dsa-{65,87}_ref). Licensed CC0 1.0 or Apache-2.0; see LICENSE-pqcrystals-dilithium.
  Changes: config.h fixes the parameter set (DILITHIUM_MODE 3 / 5) instead of reading it from the build, and its exported names are prefixed
  cmldsa_; sign.h drops liboqs' <oqs/oqs.h> include and OQS_API marker.

Keccak-p[1600] (keccak/)
  The XKCP generic 64-bit implementation as shipped in liboqs 0.14.0 (src/common/sha3/xkcp_low/KeccakP-1600/plain-64bits), by Guido Bertoni,
  Joan Daemen, Michael Peeters, Gilles Van Assche and Ronny Van Keer. CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication, stated in each file).
  Change: KeccakP-1600-SnP.h prefixes every exported function with cmldsa_.

cmldsa_sha3.c
  The SHAKE sponge of liboqs 0.14.0 (src/common/sha3/xkcp_sha3.c, from PQClean's fips202.c) without the runtime dispatch and the heap allocation.

liboqs
